The loop patterns in this repository translate mechanisms from the
psychological and cybernetic literature into agent-engineering shapes.
Each pattern names its source. Those sources are the work of their
respective authors and are cited, not reproduced, here.

Gyre is an open-core project. The measurement and control seams support
discovery of provider and controller implementations that are not part of
this repository (see src/gyre/providers/proprietary/README.md and
src/gyre/control/proprietary/README.md). Such implementations are not
distributed with this software and are not covered by the licenses above;
the licenses apply only to the code and documentation actually contained
in this distribution.
